@@section 1
@@title SQ-FGDC Fungi census rerun, 2026-11-02 ([plan_creative_delight.md](../plan_creative_delight.md) I, r1102 [scratch_run_2026-11-02.md](scratch_run_2026-11-02.md) 8; the mushroom half of SQ-FGD-12 and SQ-FGD-15)
@@date 2026-11-02
@@jars creativecommon creativedelight
@@sources feature_writeup/plan_creative_delight.md feature_writeup/testing/scratch_run_2026-11-02.md
@@text
@@text Targets the installed `mods/creativedelight-1.0.0.jar` (Fungi `-02`). r1102 could not judge these: its mushroom-fields
@@text square held 3 mushroom-fields chunks in ocean (the locate result is the nearest edge, not the middle), and five 300-radius
@@text squares held 3 animals in total (chunk-generation spawns are sparse, gotchas.md). Run with the truffle-dirt fix (I6) in, so
@@text SQ-FGD-14 shares the world. Fresh group B world (`prep_srv.sh OUT cdj5c B spawn-animals=true`, seed 8675309), disk check first
@@text (`df -h /`, Chunky squares of 300 take about 1 GB each). Batches go in `tools/scratch_query/batches/<run>/`, offline counts
@@text with `tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py`.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-FGD-12m | mushroom fields: 300+ chunks; huge inky 1 in 3, huge morel 1 in 4; singles at the surface; colonies on dirt
@group B (fresh)
@commands `/locate biome minecraft:mushroom_fields` (r1102: [-4272, -4430]); `forceload`/`tp` to it and read `/zq biometag`-style surface biomes around it with a probe, or run Chunky radius 100 at the located point and count the biome share with `region_blocks.py` (`chunks with a match by surface biome`); move the Chunky centre toward the biome interior until at least 300 chunks are mushroom_fields, then Chunky radius 150 around that centre; offline `region_blocks.py blocks` for inky / morel singles and `*_mushroom_block` (huge forms) with `--box` over the square
@pass at least 300 mushroom_fields chunks in the square; huge inky in about 1 of 3 chunks and huge morel 1 of 4 ("chunks with a match by surface biome"); inky cap and morel singles present at the surface; colonies only over dirt / podzol
@fails no mushroom_fields interior within 5000 blocks: try `level-seed=` of a mushroom-fields spawn seed in the srv properties; zero huge forms: `[mushroom-spawns]` log line, `mushroomSpawns` in CEConfig
@from batches/r1103w/w_11_B.qb
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py blocks cdj5c 'fungidelight:(inky_cap|morel)_mushroom_block$' --box {MF1-150} {MF2-150} {MF1+150} {MF2+150}
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py blocks cdj5c '(fungidelight:(inky_cap|morel)_mushroom|minecraft:(brown|red)_mushroom)$' --box {MF1-150} {MF2-150} {MF1+150} {MF2+150}
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py blocks cdj5c 'fungidelight:[a-z_]+_colony$' --near 'minecraft:(dirt|coarse_dirt|podzol|rooted_dirt|grass_block|mycelium|moss_block)$' --box {MF1-150} {MF2-150} {MF1+150} {MF2+150}
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py blocks cdj5c 'minecraft:mycelium$' --box {MF1-150} {MF2-150} {MF1+150} {MF2+150} | grep -i 'surface biome'
bootreject (?i)(error|exception).*mushroom-spawns
look "chunks with a match by surface biome": mushroom_fields at least 300 chunks; huge inky about 1 of 3 chunks, huge morel 1 of 4; inky and morel singles at depth 0..1; colonies next to dirt / podzol

## SQ-FGD-15c | animal census with enough animals; summoned and egg mooshrooms all red
@group B, same world
@commands animal census with enough animals: Chunky radius 150 over the mushroom_fields square and a dark forest and a mangrove swamp; the animals are only saved when generated, so also `/summon` 20 `minecraft:mooshroom` and 20 `fungidelight:inky_cap_cow` and `morel_cow` in each biome and `/save-all` (FGD-29: summoned and egg mooshrooms all red); `region_blocks.py entities` by biome and `Type` field
@pass mushroom fields: at least 20 mooshrooms per sample and about 25 % brown among naturally generated ones; dark forest about 50 % brown; Fungi cows rare in dark forest, morel cows in swamps (r1102: 3 morel cows in the mangrove swamp, 0 elsewhere), both common in mushroom fields; summoned and egg mooshrooms all red
@fails too few natural animals even after Chunky: judge only the summoned and egg half and the `SpawnTuning.brownChance` summary line (`[mob-spawns]`); wrong share: `SpawnTuning.brownChance`, `/dumpspawns` + `gen_spawn_table.py` with no "mod not loaded"
@from batches/r1103w/w_11_B.qb
> forceload add {MF1-24} {MF2-24} {MF1+24} {MF2+24}
sleep 10
repeat 20
> summon minecraft:mooshroom {MF1} 300 {MF2} {Tags:["fgd15mf"],NoGravity:1b}
end
repeat 20
> summon fungidelight:inky_cap_cow {MF1} 300 {MF2} {Tags:["fgd15mf"],NoGravity:1b}
end
repeat 20
> summon fungidelight:morel_cow {MF1} 300 {MF2} {Tags:["fgd15mf"],NoGravity:1b}
end
> spreadplayers {MF1} {MF2} 2 20 false @e[tag=fgd15mf]
> execute as @e[tag=fgd15mf] run data merge entity @s {NoGravity:0b}
sleep 3
> execute as @e[type=minecraft:mooshroom,tag=fgd15mf,nbt={Type:"red"}] run say FGD15c MF summoned red
> execute as @e[type=minecraft:mooshroom,tag=fgd15mf,nbt={Type:"brown"}] run say FGD15c MF summoned brown
count FGD15c MF summoned red == 20
reject FGD15c MF summoned brown
> forceload add {DF1-24} {DF3-24} {DF1+24} {DF3+24}
sleep 10
repeat 20
