end
> spreadplayers {DF1} {DF3} 2 20 false @e[tag=fgd15df]
> execute as @e[tag=fgd15df] run data merge entity @s {NoGravity:0b}
sleep 3
> execute as @e[type=minecraft:mooshroom,tag=fgd15df,nbt={Type:"red"}] run say FGD15c DF summoned red
> execute as @e[type=minecraft:mooshroom,tag=fgd15df,nbt={Type:"brown"}] run say FGD15c DF summoned brown
count FGD15c DF summoned red == 20
