> save-all flush
waitlog Saved the game 300
shell for b in "MF {MF1} {MF2}" "DF {DF1} {DF3}" "MG {MG1} {MG3}"; do set -- $b; echo "== $1 square (after summons)"; python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py entities cdj5c '^(minecraft:mooshroom|fungidelight:[a-z_]+_cow)$' --field Type --box $(($2-150)) $(($3-150)) $(($2+150)) $(($3+150)); done
shell grep -a "\[mob-spawns\]" logs/latest.log | grep -i "brown\|mooshroom" | cut -c1-300 | head -5
look natural share (SQ-FGD-15c-nat): mushroom fields at least 20 mooshrooms and about 25 % brown, dark forest about 50 % brown, Fungi cows rare in dark forest, morel cows in swamps, both common in mushroom fields; too few natural animals: judge the summoned / egg half and the SpawnTuning.brownChance line
